    "title": "Full-Stack Dev to Fix Bugs, Harden Security & Ship Core Flows on SaaS Portal",
    "ciphertext": "~022078856997873952267",
    "description": "Hi there — I’m Jake, founder of BANGER EDITS (bangeredits.com), an on-demand video editing portal for\ncreators, brands, and agencies.\nThe MVP portal has already been built (on Lovable.dev / React + Supabase stack). It’s live but has bugs, missing\nsecurity hardening, and a few core flows that need finishing before I open it up to paying customers.\nI need a full-stack developer who can: 1. QA the existing build — walk through every user flow, log bugs, fix\nthem 2. Harden security — proper auth, RBAC, rate limiting, secrets management 3. Wire up transactional\nemails — signup, brief submitted, banger delivered 4. Verify the briefing flow — customer submits brief →\neditor receives it cleanly 5. Ship the timeline feedback feature — pin comments on video timeline (already\npartially built, needs finishing) 6. Build me a proper master admin account — see all users, all projects, all\npayments, all messages",
